</label>
<h1 class="header-large">
  {{@model.address}}
</h1>
<p>
  This map shows decided Board cases filed from January 1, 1998, to the present. Active (currently open) cases are not
  displayed here.
</p>
<p>
  You can also use our other search tools,
  <a href="https://www.nyc.gov/site/oer/remediation/city-environmental-quality-review.page" target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer">
    Search for Resolutions
  </a>
   to find out more application information, look up active
  cases, and download resolutions (as applicable), and
  <a href="https://www.nyc.gov/site/oer/remediation/city-environmental-quality-review.page" target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer">
    Applications prior to 1998
  </a>
  to find calendar numbers,
  street addresses, and block and lots for decided cases prior to 1998.
  </p>
  <p>
  This data is provided solely for informational purposes and does not represent the full extent of the Board's
  jurisdiction or decisions, which date from 1916 to the present. Researchers and property owners should visit the
  <a href="https://www.nyc.gov/site/oer/remediation/city-environmental-quality-review.page" target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer">
    Records Request
  </a>
  page to request information which may be unavailable on this website.
</p>
